      "text": "Do you know that ICE’s VOICE office supports victims and families impacted by immigration-related crimes by:\n\n• Helping victims follow and understand the immigration enforcement and removal process.\n• Signing up victims to receive automated custody status information on criminal aliens in ICE custody.\n• Opportunities to ensure victims can provide victim impact statements.\n• Giving access to social service professionals and local resources.\n\n➡️To learn more, visit our web page.",
